@startuml
top to bottom direction
rectangle "sensor_task / event_task" as L
queue "publish_queue" as Q
rectangle "mqtt_task" as MT
rectangle "mqtt_service" as MS
rectangle "mqtt_adapter / ESP-MQTT" as MA
cloud "AWS IoT Core" as AWS
rectangle "cloud_command" as CC
queue "command_queue" as CQ
rectangle "command_task" as CT
rectangle "LED GPIO2" as LED
L --> Q --> MT --> MS --> MA --> AWS
AWS --> MA --> MS --> CC --> CQ --> CT --> LED

note bottom
Extensão v07: mqtt_task publica health periódico em
psi3542/<thingName>/health. Falha/recuperação do DHT11
gera eventos somente em transições.
end note
@enduml
